91
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:48,760
the log doesn't show it.
91

92
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:54,880
Actually, the end device is trying again and again, and each time it tries, it increases its 
92

93
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:55,450
Spreading Factor.
93

94
